#. (itstool) path: plugin/_short
msgid "Invert"
msgstr "反色"

#. (itstool) path: plugin/_long
msgid "A plugin to invert the colors of the whole output."
msgstr "反转整个输出颜色的插件。"

#. (itstool) path: option/_short
msgid "Toggle"
msgstr "切换"

#. (itstool) path: option/_long
msgid "Inverts the colors of the whole output with the specified activator."
msgstr "使用指定激活器反转整个输出的颜色。"

#. (itstool) path: option/_short
msgid "Preserve Hue"
msgstr "保留色相"

#. (itstool) path: option/_long
msgid "Only operate on black and white, preserving the hue"
msgstr "仅对黑色和白色进行操作，保留色相。"
